# Credits and notices

| Contribution | Origin and terms |
| --- | --- |
| Sealegs hardware, stock DSP and official firmware | [Intellijel Designs](https://intellijel.com/shop/eurorack/sealegs/). Obtain the stock image from [Intellijel's repository](https://github.com/intellijel/firmware/tree/master/bin). The release does not distribute an Intellijel firmware image. |
| Seal Eggs, live reverse, Character, Stepped Doppler, Tape Fast/Bright, BBD Light, Seal Beads and Seal Microloops | [BRIBERY](https://www.thisisbribery.com/sealeggs/), [source project](https://github.com/thisisbribery/SealEggs_v1). [Seal Eggs license](notices/Seal-Eggs-LICENSE.md). PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 covers BRIBERY’s own mods, code, patch data, flasher and adaptations of Beads/stmlib. BRIBERY grants additional permissions for professional music and commercial use by Intellijel. |
| Beads and stmlib inside Seal Beads | [Émilie Gillet / Mutable Instruments](https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack). The [MIT notice](notices/Beads-MIT.txt) is reproduced with its copyright. BRIBERY adapted the engine to Sealegs. |
| Browser DFU libraries | Intellijel's updater and the webdfu authors. See the [Intellijel notice](vendor/INTELLIJEL-LICENSE.txt) and [webdfu notice](vendor/WEBDFU-LICENSE.txt). [Intellijel source](https://github.com/intellijel/firmware/tree/4201c75802659e42be79bd3c436807ef2f1a8835). |
| Redux additions, patcher, listening example and new guides | Copyright © 2026 vwal. [Redux Attribution – No Sale License](LICENSE.txt), with an official Intellijel commercial-integration exception limited to vwal’s original firmware changes in the Redux delta over Seal Eggs. BRIBERY grants its own Intellijel exception under separate terms. |

Required Notice: Copyright 2026 Bribery (https://thisisbribery.com)

## Use and redistribution

