# Seal Eggs licence

Required Notice: Copyright 2026 Bribery (https://thisisbribery.com)

Seal Eggs by Bribery is licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 (full text at the end of this file), plus the additional permissions below.

## What this covers

Bribery's own Seal Eggs work: the mods and their code, the patch data in `mods.js`, the flasher page, and Bribery's changes to the Beads and stmlib code inside Seal Beads. Seal Microloops is original Bribery code and is covered in full.

## What this does not cover

- **Intellijel's Sealegs firmware.** It belongs to Intellijel. Seal Eggs never includes it: you supply your own copy of the official file.
- **Mutable Instruments Beads and stmlib code** by Emilie Gillet inside Seal Beads. That code stays under the MIT licence in [LICENSE-beads.txt](LICENSE-beads.txt), and its notice must be kept with every copy.

## In plain English

- **Free for noncommercial use.** Use it, study it, change it and share it for free.
- **Forks are welcome**, on the same noncommercial terms. Keep the `Required Notice:` line above, include or link these terms, and credit Bribery's Seal Eggs.
- **Make and sell music with it.** See the first additional permission below.
- **Don't sell it.** No selling the firmware, the patch data, changed versions, pre-flashed modules or paid packs that include it, and no bundling it with a commercial product, without written permission from Bribery.

## Additional permissions

These are granted by Bribery on top of the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0.

### Music

You may use Seal Eggs to make, perform, record, release and sell music and sound, including paid gigs, sessions, releases and other professional music work. This covers the music and sound you make with it. It does not allow selling or distributing Seal Eggs itself for money.

### Commercial exception for Intellijel

Intellijel, the maker of the Sealegs, may use, copy, change and distribute Bribery's Seal Eggs work for any purpose, including commercial use, for example by including Seal Eggs modes in official Sealegs firmware. This permission is for Intellijel only and can't be passed on, except to users as part of Intellijel's own products.

## Commercial licence

For any other commercial use, contact Bribery through https://thisisbribery.com or [@thisisbribery](https://www.instagram.com/thisisbribery/) on Instagram.

